Whisplay Rust

The LCD initialization sequence in
whisplay-driver/src/bin/whisplayd/hardware.rs is adapted from PiSugar Whisplay's
runtime/whisplay.py (WhisplayBoard._init_display), licensed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/PiSugar/Whisplay

The Rust implementation uses gpio-cdev and spidev, with display ownership,
rendering and playback implemented in this project. See LICENSE for Apache-2.0.

